        {
            "id": "WbJ2Ql",
            "content_html": "<h2>整合包：废土之下-废墟之城。</h2>\n<p>![屏幕截图 2026-09-15 041836.png](<a href=\"https://picui.ogmua.cn/s1/2026/09/15/6aa856c5a02b\">https://picui.ogmua.cn/s1/2026/09/15/6aa856c5a02b</a></p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/feituzhixia\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/feituzhixia</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/feituzhixia",
            "title": "废土之下-废墟之城",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "kBHwKP",
            "content_html": "<p>Alexcraft<br>\n艾利克斯的世界为一款以洞穴探索，种田养老为主题的轻量化定制整合包。<br>\n它作为高养老型，十分适合女生游玩。<br>\n高清大图：<br>\n![screenshot-2026-07-07-160824.</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/Alexcraft-mc\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/Alexcraft-mc</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/Alexcraft-mc",
            "title": "高养老向整合包",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-08T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-08T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "0YSTjt",
            "content_html": "<p>此篇文章用于如果你不知道去哪里下载Java，请至此处下载<br>\n![screenshot-2026-07-07-162816.avif](<a href=\"https://user16259.cn.imgto.link/p\">https://user16259.cn.imgto.link/p</a></p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/Java-download\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/Java-download</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/Java-download",
            "title": "Java全版本下载",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "wQpNY2",
            "content_html": "<p>经过本网站内的前两篇联机教程文章，想必你应该已经学会了基本的联机方式。<br>\n那么在此，我将一步步教导你如何使用樱花穿透进行联机。</p>\n<p>（一），搜索樱花映射，如下图。<br>\n![screenshot-2026-0</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/SakuraFrp-1\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/SakuraFrp-1</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/SakuraFrp-1",
            "title": "MC樱花联机教程",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "cXCtMp",
            "content_html": "<p>这是一款低配光影，有着温和，不刺眼的柔和光影，低配机可使用。<br>\n![screenshot-2026-07-07-155044.avif](<a href=\"https://user16259.cn.imgto.link\">https://user16259.cn.imgto.link</a></p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/make-up\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/make-up</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/make-up",
            "title": "MC低配光影",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "snPLkx",
            "content_html": "<p>这是一款十分适合女生的养老型整合包，低配渣机也可流畅运行。<br>\n高清大图：<br>\n![38c52e60.avif](<a href=\"https://user16259.cn.imgto.link/public/2026070\">https://user16259.cn.imgto.link/public/2026070</a></p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/yang-lao\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/yang-lao</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/yang-lao",
            "title": "一款适合女生的养老向整合包",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "XtoxGl",
            "content_html": "<p>这是一款以建筑为内容的整合包，适合建筑玩家的整合包。<br>\n它专门为建筑玩家而构建。<br>\n专为MC建筑党设计的的建筑整合，整合包内置50余个多元风格的建筑装饰模组，包括现代、中世纪、中欧、中式、原版以及高分辨</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/zhu-meng-wu-yu\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/zhu-meng-wu-yu</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/zhu-meng-wu-yu",
            "title": "一款建筑向整合包",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "FCSGlA",
            "content_html": "<p>我们已知123云盘是国内较为小有名气的网盘商。<br>\n免费用户注册即享2TB大空间云存储，但这似乎换来的代价是广告。<br>\n它在移动端强塞进了一些莫名其妙的广告，因此，我前往某技术论坛获取了一份安装包。<br>\n它去除</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/123-mod-apk\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/123-mod-apk</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/123-mod-apk",
            "title": "123云盘去广告绿色精简版",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "jfZ3dV",
            "content_html": "<p>如你所见，这是一款基于PCL-CE社区版开发的更完善的PCL版启动器。<br>\n它支持什么？它或许当前没有什么值得一提的新功能，但它支持了自动安装前置mod。<br>\n当你在安装某些mod文件至你的mods文件夹时</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/PCL-CE-N\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/PCL-CE-N</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/PCL-CE-N",
            "title": "一款支持自动安装前置依赖的启动器",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "MiC3NJ",
            "content_html": "<p>这是第二款免费的，基于bilibili平台的免费云音乐播放器。<br>\n构建于Windows系统。Windows用户可下载安装使用。<br>\ngithub搬运。<br>\n![screenshot-2026-07-04-04</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/bili-musci-Windows\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/bili-musci-Windows</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/bili-musci-Windows",
            "title": "bilibili免费云音乐播放器two",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "9XNJAA",
            "content_html": "<p>你是否因为喜欢听音乐，却苦于总是需要在某音乐平台开通会员？<br>\n这是一款基于bilibili的免费云音乐播放器，并构建于Android平台,使移动端玩家不再受固定一平台问题而困扰。<br>\n![20260704</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/bilibili-two\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/bilibili-two</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/bilibili-two",
            "title": "一款Android上基于bilibili的免费音乐播放器",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "wiEMa3",
            "content_html": "<p>这是一款难度不高的冒险向整合包，现在仍旧是初始版本，但可玩性很高，寿命较长。<br>\n它的内容涵盖：养老/建筑/魔法/高铁/枪械/星系/拔刀剑/工业/冒险/龙坐骑<br>\n![screenshot-2026-07-</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/mo-ni-ren-sheng\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/mo-ni-ren-sheng</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://zhifa616.github.io/posts/mo-ni-ren-sheng",
            "title": "一款模拟人生的整合包",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "CCCP",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "uNDMZy",
